<title>INDONESIA: S. Africa's Mandela to visit Indonesia in July.</title>
<headline>S. Africa's Mandela to visit Indonesia in July.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African President Nelson Mandela will pay a state visit to Indonesia from July 14-16, the South African embassy in Jakarta said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The main themes of President Mandela's visit would be to enhance cooperation between South Africa and Indonesia in the field of trade and investment, as well as multilateral political cooperation,&quot; the embassy said in a statement.</p>
<p>The statement said it would be the third visit to Indonesia by Mandela since his release from prison in 1990, but only the first state visit.</p>
</text>
